  "bodyHash": "2EVhyR/lQus=",
  "content": "<h3><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0cf\">MOA DECOR: 浴室</span></strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">這是一款裝飾模組，旨在為你的建築增添新的浴室主題物件。目前已有許多家具模組，而本模組旨在成為它們的補充，因為你可以找到數百種不同的物件和元素來裝飾你的世界。這是</span></em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">MOA DECOR</span></em></span></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">系列中的又一力作。</span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/635/moa-sanitario7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"672\"></span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">合成方式</span></strong></h3><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/932/c-sanitario-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"477\" height=\"231\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">本模組中的所有物品都可以在生存模式中獲得。要開始製作這些物件，你需要在工作台上放置一個<strong>淺藍色</strong>染料和一顆綠寶石，這樣你將獲得<strong>9個浴室寶石</strong>，然後將它們與其他材料結合，就能製作出裝飾物品。<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>總共有162種不同的物品！</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/933/c-sanitario-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"477\" height=\"232\"></strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>範例：</strong> 如果你想製作馬桶模型，其合成配方中必須包含一顆浴室寶石，以及該物件的額外材料，在此例中為一個鐵方塊、一個石製按鈕、一個拋光閃長岩方塊和一個水桶）。有些次要合成配方是由兩個模型的物件組合而成。在這些情況下，不需要寶石，因為在先前的合成中已經使用過了。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/934/moa-sanitario1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"476\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/935/moa-sanitario2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"492\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/936/moa-sanitario3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"470\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/937/moa-sanitario4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"481\"></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/938/moa-sanitario5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1462\" height=\"610\"></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/634/moa-sanitario6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"811\"></em></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/636/moa-sanitario8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1171\" height=\"753\"></em></span></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><em>備註：</em></strong></span><em> 為了獲得更完整的體驗，建議查看</em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><em>MOA DECOR</em></strong></span><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>系列的其他模組</strong></span>，其中有更多分類可以補充此模組。</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 烹飪\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 藝術\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 科學\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 玩具\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 浴室\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 燈光\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></em></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
